Code whose PowerPC behaviour depends on things the host does not
reproduce. KartStrat::DoStarCrl returns an uninitialised local, which on
PowerPC still holds the speed argument from f1, so the host initialises
it with the argument. KartItem calls getNowTandemDriverNum through a cast
function pointer type (an invalid bitcast that traps in wasm); the host
calls it directly and converts the result. JPAVolumeSphere divides by
(count - 1), which PowerPC's divw tolerates for zero and wasm traps on.

